WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.192
Henny Penny was a chicken.

2
00:00:05.193 --> 00:00:08.091
She was a hungry chicken.

3
00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:12.474
One day, she was looking for food on the ground.

4
00:00:12.475 --> 00:00:16.340
Suddenly, a nut fell off of a tree.

5
00:00:16.341 --> 00:00:20.318
The nut hit Henny Penny on the head.

6
00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:24.475
"Oh my! The sky is falling!

7
00:00:24.476 --> 00:00:28.452
I must tell the king!" Henny Penny said.

8
00:00:28.453 --> 00:00:31.008
She ran by the barn.

9
00:00:31.009 --> 00:00:35.107
Cocky Locky said, "Cock-a-doodle-doo!

10
00:00:35.108 --> 00:00:39.142
Henny Penny, where are you going?"

11
00:00:39.143 --> 00:00:43.186
Henny Penny replied, "The sky is falling!

12
00:00:43.187 --> 00:00:45.103
I must tell the king!

13
00:00:45.104 --> 00:00:47.241
Why don't you come too?"

14
00:00:47.242 --> 00:00:51.197
"I will!" Cocky Locky said.

15
00:00:51.198 --> 00:00:53.450
They ran by the lake.

16
00:00:53.451 --> 00:00:59.145
Ducky Lucky said, "Quack, quack, Henny Penny and Cocky Locky!

17
00:00:59.146 --> 00:01:01.596
Where are you going?"

18
00:01:01.597 --> 00:01:05.374
They replied, "The sky is falling!

19
00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:07.522
We must tell the king!

20
00:01:07.523 --> 00:01:10.211
Why don't you come too?"

21
00:01:10.212 --> 00:01:14.444
"I will!" Ducky Lucky said.

22
00:01:14.445 --> 00:01:16.858
They ran by the river.

23
00:01:16.859 --> 00:01:25.361
Goosey Loosey said, "Honk, honk, Henny Penny, Cocky Locky, and Ducky Lucky!

24
00:01:25.362 --> 00:01:28.621
Where are you going?"

25
00:01:28.622 --> 00:01:32.412
They replied, "The sky is falling!

26
00:01:32.413 --> 00:01:34.600
We must tell the king!

27
00:01:34.601 --> 00:01:37.168
Why don't you come too?"

28
00:01:37.169 --> 00:01:41.953
"I will!" Goosey Loosey said.

29
00:01:41.954 --> 00:01:44.570
They ran into the forest.

30
00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:54.016
Turkey Lurkey said, "Gobble, gobble, gobble, Henny Penny, Cocky Locky, Ducky Lucky, and Goosey Loosey!

31
00:01:54.017 --> 00:01:56.625
Where are you going?"

32
00:01:56.626 --> 00:02:00.410
They replied, "The sky is falling!

33
00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:02.481
We must tell the king!

34
00:02:02.482 --> 00:02:05.386
Why don't you come too?"

35
00:02:05.387 --> 00:02:09.649
"I will!" Turkey Lurkey said.

36
00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.670
They ran by a cave.

37
00:02:12.671 --> 00:02:22.618
Foxy Loxy saw Henny Penny, Cocky Locky, Ducky Lucky, Goosey Loosey, and Turkey Lurkey.

38
00:02:22.619 --> 00:02:26.377
"I will invite them into my cave.

39
00:02:26.378 --> 00:02:31.014
Then, I can eat them!" said Foxy Loxy.

40
00:02:31.015 --> 00:02:38.739
"Ah, Henny Penny, Cocky Locky, Ducky Lucky, Goosey Loosey, and Turkey Lurkey!

41
00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:41.605
Where are you going?"

42
00:02:41.606 --> 00:02:45.512
They replied, "The sky is falling!

43
00:02:45.513 --> 00:02:47.573
We must tell the king!

44
00:02:47.574 --> 00:02:50.198
Why don't you come too?"

45
00:02:50.199 --> 00:02:56.349
"I will! But first, rest in my cave," said Foxy Loxy.

46
00:02:56.350 --> 00:03:00.197
Suddenly, a nut fell off of a tree.

47
00:03:00.198 --> 00:03:04.032
The nut hit Foxy Loxy on the head.

48
00:03:04.033 --> 00:03:07.398
"Oh my! The sky is falling!

49
00:03:07.399 --> 00:03:09.090
We must tell the king!

50
00:03:09.091 --> 00:03:12.507
You must come too!" she cried.

51
00:03:12.508 --> 00:03:23.107
But Henny Penny, Cocky Locky, Ducky Lucky, Goosey Loosey, and Turkey Lurkey said, "The sky is not falling.

52
00:03:23.108 --> 00:03:25.690
A nut fell on your head!

53
00:03:25.691 --> 00:03:28.633
Let's all go home."

54
00:03:28.634 --> 00:03:33.776
But Foxy Loxy kept saying, "The sky is falling!

55
00:03:33.777 --> 00:03:36.020
The sky is falling!"

56
00:03:36.021 --> 00:03:44.402
Henny Penny, Cocky Locky, Ducky Lucky, Goosey Loosey, and Turkey Lurkey all laughed.

57
00:03:44.403 --> 00:03:49.604
Foxy Loxy shouted again, "The sky is falling!"

58
00:03:49.605 --> 00:03:56.951
Then she ran away to tell the king.

